 >His younger sister, the only family he had left, disappeared 20 years ago and he still travels the country trying to find out the truth behind her disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a freak accident strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he opened his eyes, all he saw was steam, running machinery, and... The tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realizing that his sister is in the giant tower in front of him, he starts a death race up and down the hellish tower to find the truth about his missing sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199080/extras/ddeec2db275fc37d1ba123fe74b82bf9.poster.avif?t=1770368742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199080/extras/ddeec2db275fc37d1ba123fe74b82bf9.webm?t=1770368742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199080/extras/ddeec2db275fc37d1ba123fe74b82bf9.mp4?t=1770368742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >side-scrolling platformer action roguelite game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HellPunk is a roguelite-style action and platformer game with a different map and enemy composition every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199080/extras/69b754aedd0215d9bc8426fb709c7421.poster.avif?t=1770368742\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199080/extras/69b754aedd0215d9bc8426fb709c7421.webm?t=1770368742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou