8742 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your build with a variety of upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Gears' with different buffs inspired by Solomon's 72 Demons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Skill Swap' to switch out and enhance skills to your taste</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Operating Table' to grant permanent physical enhancements with bloodstones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your build with a wide variety of compelling upgrades that match the unique atmosphere of HellPunk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199080/extras/5082aef14b8adc922d61a255854d43f7.avif?t=1770368742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199080/extras_big/5082aef14b8adc922d61a255854d43f7.avif?t=1770368742 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse side stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll meet a variety of interesting NPCs in your basecamp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC has their own story and will ask you to help them with various tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their requests can be as simple as asking you to kill a monster, or as complex as forcing you to make a difficult, brutal choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique and delicately crafted hell through quests.</p>","developers":["Urban Oasis"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199080/6bb64ad85a348a607a85bd289b60f931f6cb74e2/header.jpg?t=1770368742","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</